title: DRY in the CLI
pid: 78519f5a-0bfe-4809-aef9-89aee01f8566
body: |2-
  Do not tell me in brief in the CLI what you have already written
  for me at length in a .org document. Just point me to it.
  Often, literally "goto <doc>"
  is all I want to read in your CLI response.

  (But do, of course, tell me there what I won't find
  in the docs you're pointing me at.)
